&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:
none;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB&quot;&gt;The application as submitted comprises of
inconsistent plans and insufficient detailing, relating to (i) the proposed
material treatment of the rear elevation at ground floor&amp;nbsp;(ii) the absence
of waste and refuse storage details. As such it is not possible to establish
that the development complies with policy 20, 53,&amp;nbsp;57, 93 of Waltham Forest
Local Plan LP1 (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:
none;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB&quot;&gt;The applicant has failed to enter into a S106
agreement and therefore not in compliance with Policy 94 of the Waltham Forest
Local Plan LP1 (2024) and&amp;nbsp;the Waltham Forest Supplementary Planning
Document “Planning Obligations” SPD, specifically in relation to the following
planning obligations requirements:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-fareast-language:
     EN-GB&quot;&gt;Secure car free development&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
