     SANGs&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:
none;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB&quot;&gt;The proposal fails to demonstrate that
adequate measures have been incorporated in the development to address the
appearance in the public realm and visual amenity of refuse and recycling
facilities for neighbours, and secure cycle parking. It cannot be confirmed
that the development would accord with Policy 20, 53, 57 and 93 of&amp;nbsp;Waltham
Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:
none;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB&quot;&gt;The proposed development would compromise the
amenity of proposed occupants of the upper flat (identified as 41b) by virtue
of failing to meet minimum internal space standards, particularly considering
the overall gross internal area, floorspace of Bedroom 3 and the floor to
ceiling height, and failing to provide any external private amenity
space,&amp;nbsp;contrary to Policies 20, 53 and 56 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan
LP1 (2024) and Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
